{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/bianca-reportage-properties-wadi-al-safa","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":337,"crm_id":"74","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Bianca","slug":"bianca-reportage-properties-wadi-al-safa","display_address":"Wadi Al Safa 2","building_type":["apartment","townhouse"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Reportage Properties","price":1080000,"display_price":"1.08M","lattitude":25.0826111,"longitude":55.3314788,"min_bedrooms":2,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Introducing Bianca by Reportage Properties, a new development located in the City of Arabia, Dubailand, offering one of a kind premium <strong>2, 3 and 4 bedroom</strong> townhouses. These incredible townhouses are the epitome of luxury spread throughout, creating a fun atmosphere in the heart of vibrant Dubai. These freehold residences have incredible design and amazing décor, making life here incredible. In the heart of the allure of Dubai yet tucked away from the bustle, lies Bianca. A masterpiece of modernity manifested in a community of brilliantly designed townhouses; where the ample sunlight falls on the pure white exteriors to radiate beauty, and the double-glazed glass balconies reflect the splendour of the lush greens. Spanning over an area of 112,035 sq.m., Bianca offers a wide range of exceptional facilities and a whole spectrum of options, to indulge in an incomparable life experience, and dive deep into Dubai’s charm with its vibrancy, luxury, and pure tranquility.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/74/images/2023/6/15/GQWPJeiKCEgPgpDjVHUJYhUVErgaoTaBs8KLYvzl.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/6/15/GQWPJeiKCEgPgpDjVHUJYhUVErgaoTaBs8KLYvzl.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{